<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rise in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rise in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 8.4 percent in the week ended November 1, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 20.5 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 4.6 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 20.5 percent to 372.9 from 309.4 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 6.3 percent to 189.7 in the latest survey from 178.4 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
